<title>USA: Ambac Financial sets two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Ambac Financial sets two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambac Financial Group Inc said Thursday its board has approved a two-for-one split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the split will be paid Sept. 10 to shareholders of record as of Aug. 29 and will be disseminated as a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company said its directors believe the stock split will result in a share price that is more attractive to a broader spectrum of investors.</p>
<p>The company's stock was trading at 84-13/16, up 1-13/16, in early trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
